<div class="bg-color-tutorial">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="row justify-content-center text-white pt-1 pb-3">
      <div class="text-center py-4">
        <h1 class="fw-bold">チュートリアル</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="font-monospace px-4 mb-5">
        <h2 class="text-center">STEP1</h2>
        <h2 class="text-center fs-xlarge fs-md-xxlarge mb-4">パルマ(手拍子)の叩き方紹介</h2>
        <div class="card rounded bg-color border card-shadow-dark border-white border-1 text-white p-2 p-md-4">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title border-bottom border-2 d-inline-block fs-larger fs-md-xlarge mb-3">1. フラメンコのパルマとは？</h4>
            <div class="card-text fs-lg-large px-2">
              <p class=" mb-1">手拍子を表します。<br>セコ（高い音）・ソルダ（低い音）の二種類の叩き方があり、リズムを支えるドラムのような役割があります。</p>
              <p>本場スペインでは手拍子専門のアーティスト(パルメーロ)がいるほど、フラメンコを支える重要な役割を担っています。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title border-bottom border-2 d-inline-block fs-larger fs-md-xlarge mb-3">2. 叩き方紹介</h4>
            <div class="row px-3">
              <div class="col">
                <h5 class="card-text fs-medium fs-md-large fs-lg-larger">★ セコ（高い音）</h5>
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 ">
                  <iframe class="rounded" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/32uA1pBfG38" title="YouTube video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <%# <iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/32uA1pBfG38" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe> %>
              </div>
              <div class="w-100 d-lg-none pt-4"></div>
              <div class="col">
                <h5 class="card-text fs-medium fs-md-large fs-lg-larger">★ ソルダ（低い音）</h5>
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9">
                  <iframe class="rounded" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UHfeQC1aL1Y" title="YouTube video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <%# <iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UHfeQC1aL1Y" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe> %>
              </div>
              <div class="card-text text-center pt-4 pt-xl-5">
                <p class="fs-lg-large mb-0">ソルダ(低い音)の方が簡単に叩くことができます！<br>好きな叩き方で真似てみましょう！</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="font-monospace px-4 my-3 my-lg-5">
        <h2 class="text-center">STEP2</h2>
        <h2 class="text-center fs-xlarge fs-md-xxlarge mb-4 mb-lg-5">音源に合わせてパルマ(手拍子)を録音しよう</h2>
        <%# <p class="text-center text-white pt-2 mb-4">難易度を選択!</p> %>
        <div class="row flex-column flex-lg-row align-items-center justify-content-lg-center">
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-6 col-md-5 col-lg-3 mb-2 me-lg-5">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-medium fs-md-large fs-lg-large mb-2">難易度☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "テンポに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "easy" }%>
          </div>
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-6 col-md-5 col-lg-3 mb-2 me-lg-5">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-medium fs-md-large fs-lg-large mb-2">難易度☆☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "リズムに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "normal" }%>
          </div>
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-6 col-md-5 col-lg-3 mb-2">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-medium fs-md-large fs-lg-large mb-2">難易度☆☆☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "メロディーに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "hard" }%>
          </div>
          <div class="">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
